dit communities, or Discord servers related to Exalted or tabletop gaming often have dedicated sections or channels for buying and selling. Join these groups and share your listing there, following any specific rules or guidelines they may have.<br /> <br /> Local Game Stores: Check with your local game stores to see if they have a buy/sell program for used gaming books. Some stores may accept trade-ins or offer consignment options for selling your books.<br /> I try to sell my book on amazon and in my work I use different tools like google disc and excel + app for <a href=\"https://workspace.google.com/marketplace/app/clean_email_list_bulk_email_verification/53011246076\" target=\"_blank\">verify email address</a>\u200b<br /> Remember, always be transparent about the condition of your books, provide clear images, and accurately describe them to potential buyers. It's also important to consider pricing your books competitively based on their condition, rarity, and demand.\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27939,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27939-dazert1","user":"Dazert1","date":". 06-09-2023, 11:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27939-dazert1","name":"Dazert1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27939_1.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-19T06:22:16-07:00","id":1524273,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the advice, I appreciate it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28202-karajoe","name":"KaraJoe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}